<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>Last updated: October 2026</p>

<h2>Introduction</h2>

<p>
Sand Simulator is a relaxing interactive sandbox app that allows users to
explore flowing sand, color mixing, particle physics, and hourglass simulations.
Your privacy is important to us.
</p>

<h2>Information Storage</h2>

<p>
Sand Simulator processes simulation settings, color preferences, and other app
preferences directly on your device.
Any saved creations or settings are stored locally on your device, where applicable.
The app does not upload your simulation data or personal information to our servers.
</p>

<h2>Simulation Data</h2>

<p>
Sand Simulator simulates sand particles, color interactions, gravity effects,
and other visual effects within the app.
</p>

<p>
Simulation data is processed locally on your device and is not transmitted to
our servers.
</p>

<h2>Personal Data Collection</h2>

<p>
Sand Simulator does not require account registration and does not directly collect
personal information such as:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Name</li>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Phone number</li>
    <li>Physical address</li>
</ul>

<h2>Advertising</h2>

<p>
Sand Simulator uses Google AdMob to display advertisements.
AdMob may collect certain information automatically, including device identifiers,
advertising data, and usage information, in accordance with Google's privacy practices.
</p>

<p>
For more information, please review Google's Privacy Policy:
</p>

<p>
<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">
https://policies.google.com/privacy
</a>
</p>

<h2>Analytics</h2>

<p>
Sand Simulator may use Google Firebase Analytics to collect app usage and
interaction information to help us understand app performance and improve
the user experience.
</p>

<p>
Analytics data may include app interactions, device information, and diagnostic
information, depending on the applicable settings and services.
Such data is processed in accordance with Google's privacy practices.
</p>

<p>
For more information, please review Google's Privacy Policy:
</p>

<p>
<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">
https://policies.google.com/privacy
</a>
</p>

<h2>In-App Purchases</h2>

<p>
Sand Simulator may provide optional in-app purchases to unlock premium features.
All payments are processed through Google Play.
</p>

<p>
We do not collect or store your payment card details. Payment information is
handled by Google Play in accordance with its privacy and payment policies.
</p>

<h2>Data Security</h2>

<p>
App preferences and locally saved simulation data are stored on your device,
where applicable, and are not transmitted to our servers.
Data processed by third-party services, such as advertising and analytics providers,
is subject to their respective privacy practices.
</p>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
Sand Simulator is not specifically directed toward children under the age of 13.
We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children.
Third-party services used by the app may process certain information as described
in their respective privacy policies.
</p>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

<p>
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
Any updates will be posted on this page.
</p>

